  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Manna and quails explained by Al-Muyassar; the gate (door) and forgiveness (light); the punishment from the sky (59) gets no picture. STAGING v4: 57: the people in the wilderness (both tafsirs: التيه), the camera rises to the sky on «الغمام», birds cross on «السلوى», they sit to eat on «كلوا», then turn away (Muyassar: فلم تمتثلوا). 58-59: they walk into the town (Muyassar: بيت المقدس) and bow on «سجدا», speak on «وقولوا»; the wrongdoers among them (As-Sa'di: not all of them) appear on «فبدل» and speak; the punishment from the sky is not drawn (its form is not stated) and the crawling detail is not drawn."
 },
